This project builds on Memorilla (https://github.com/snap-stanford/memorilla),
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. Some files in experiments/ adapt code
and logic from it, and the scripts import it at run time. Changes: ported to
run on a laptop (MPS/CPU), plus new experiment scripts for the 16-token memory
path.

The benchmark's chats were generated by Qwen3-8B. Facts were extracted from
them by Qwen3-8B, plus 21 from 4 example chats in
https://github.com/andrisgauracs/memorilla-demos (read as data only).
